==Trivia==
This card forms part of a {{TCGP|narrative illustration|perspective illustration}} with {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Electivire|25}} from the same set; both cards' illustrations originated from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion. Additionally, the name of Magmortar's Thundering Volcano attack references the connection between both Pokémon, with a secondary effect activated if the player has Electivire in play.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Magmortar|20}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

